  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Palestine activities are focused on meeting the urgent needs of older people, people with disabilities and other vulnerable groups and has an overarching focus on communities. In Lebanon, activities will be implemented in the Mount Lebanon region, targeting the significant population of internally displaced persons (IDPs) residing in collective shelters and inadequate housing. These activities aim to address the urgent needs of the IDPs, with a particular focus on older individuals</narrative>
